// Slow measure 1, naive form, shaped like a matrix: Outturn as at Release by release (rows) and financial year (columns),
// the figure each of the 31 releases gave for each year it had reached.
EVALUATE
SUMMARIZECOLUMNS (
    'Release'[Release Label],
    'Fiscal Year'[Financial Year],
    "as_at", [Outturn as at Release]
)
ORDER BY 'Release'[Release Label], 'Fiscal Year'[Financial Year]
